stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> DRAFT
  DRAFT --> ANALYZING: Analyze
  CHANGES_REQUIRED --> ANALYZING: Re-analyze
  ANALYZING --> DRAFT: Results stored
  DRAFT --> READY_FOR_REVIEW: Submit with analysis
  CHANGES_REQUIRED --> READY_FOR_REVIEW: Submit with valid analysis
  READY_FOR_REVIEW --> APPROVED: Different reviewer + comments
  READY_FOR_REVIEW --> CHANGES_REQUIRED: Reviewer + comments
  APPROVED --> READY_TO_PUBLISH: Reviewer marks ready
  READY_TO_PUBLISH --> DRAFT: Reopen and invalidate
  APPROVED --> DRAFT: Reopen and invalidate
  READY_FOR_REVIEW --> DRAFT: Reopen and invalidate
  CHANGES_REQUIRED --> DRAFT: Edit invalidates analysis
  note right of READY_TO_PUBLISH: No direct publishing
